  "post_content": "<p>El domingo por la tarde se inaugur&oacute; el Bel&eacute;n de la cofrad&iacute;a de La Macarena de Onda, en su local de la calle Metge Jos&eacute; Llid&oacute;, que tiene referencias locales, como la Font de Dins, el castillo o el Museo del Carmen.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/12/IMG_5407.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Bel&eacute;n, que es narrado y muchos de sus pasajes tienen movimiento, estar&aacute; abierto hasta el d&iacute;a 6 de enero, en horario de 17.30 a 20 horas.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5391.jpg\" alt=\"img_5391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5392.jpg\" alt=\"img_5392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5393.jpg\" alt=\"img_5393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5394.jpg\" alt=\"img_5394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5395.jpg\" alt=\"img_5395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5396.jpg\" alt=\"img_5396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5397.jpg\" alt=\"img_5397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5398.jpg\" alt=\"img_5398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5399.jpg\" alt=\"img_5399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5400.jpg\" alt=\"img_5400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5401.jpg\" alt=\"img_5401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5402.jpg\" alt=\"img_5402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5403.jpg\" alt=\"img_5403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5404.jpg\" alt=\"img_5404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5405.jpg\" alt=\"img_5405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5406.jpg\" alt=\"img_5406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5407.jpg\" alt=\"img_5407\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5408.jpg\" alt=\"img_5408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5409.jpg\" alt=\"img_5409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5411.jpg\" alt=\"img_5411\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/belenmacarena/img_5412.jpg\" alt=\"img_5412\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
